<title>GERMANY: GERMAN DATA DUE - Unemployment, wholesale sales.</title>
<headline>GERMAN DATA DUE - Unemployment, wholesale sales.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following German economic indicators are expected to be released next week:</p>
<p>    INDICATOR	PERIOD	 PREVIOUS		 EXPECTED</p>
<p>					    DATA		     DATE</p>
<p> Unemployment	March	  4.316 million, 12.2 pct   April 8</p>
<p> Wholesale sales   February     +2.5 pct m/m	    April 8-9</p>
<p>NOTE - The Federal Statistics Office said the expected release dates were targets. The unemployment data will be released by the Federal Labour Office. The previous data show the seasonally adjusted number of unemployed, and the unadjusted unemployment rate for February.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
